/T ( In SPECPOL, we will confront two critical issues at the heart of this instability: the rise of state-sponsored proxy warfare driven by strategic resources and regional influence, and the growing challenge of sanctions evasion and the illicit trade of strategic resources through black markets.These are not problems with simple solutions. They demand that you question the systems that allow instability to persist, weigh the interests of your nation against the responsibilities of the international community, and, most importantly, engineer solutions capable of creating lasting stability.)
